What you will have ready today
By the end of Day 0, you should be able to:

access GitHub;
access Docker Hub;
install and open Visual Studio Code;
install Git and verify that it works;
install Docker and verify that it can run a container;
install and open IGV.

These steps should be completed before the start of the workshop.
For any problems, questions, or installation issues, follow the issue-reporting instructions at the end of this page.

6. Report a setup problem
If a setup problem remains after checking the table above, email:
francesco.gualdrini@gmail.com
Use this exact email subject:
Issue - Reproducible NGS workshop
In the message, include:

your operating system and version;
the Day 0 step where the problem occurred;
the command you ran;
the complete error message or a screenshot of it;
which readiness checks completed successfully.

Do not include passwords, access tokens, or account recovery codes.
